{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32132","headline":"雉场歌 · 温庭筠","name":"雉场歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"茭叶萋萋接烟曙，鸡鸣埭上梨花露。\n彩杖锵锵已合围，绣翎白颈遥相妬。\n雕尾扇张金缕高，碎铃素拂骊驹豪。\n绿场红迹未相接，箭发铜牙伤彩毛。\n麦陇桑阴小山晚，六虬归去凝笳远。\n城头却望几含情，青亩春芜连石苑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32132.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32132","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}